I am now in my room.
This room is new.
The room is very quiet.
I look around.
There is a switch on the wall there.
I turn on the fan's switch.
The ceiling fan spins above.
There is a bed in the room.
And there is a sturdy table.
The room is small.
But it is nice.
I go near the window.
I look outside.
It is night outside.
This city is very big.
Everything is completely new.
I suddenly miss Mexico.
My home is very far away.
I am a little sad.
